{"1936530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Subsequence", "steam_appid": 1936530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✅ What the game IS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ~2‑hour, self‑contained, atmospheric narrative experience designed to be completed in one sitting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on exploration and discovery, with only light logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist controls - WASD to move, E to interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light‑hearted tone - the game doesn’t take itself too seriously</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>❌ What the game is NOT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Subsequence</i> is not a traditional, puzzle‑heavy adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re looking for complex logic puzzles, long playtime, or branching dialogue trees, this may not be the right experience for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 🎮 Demo</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available and reflects the tone and core mechanics of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best experienced with headphones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence takes you through an underground research facility, a burning elevator shaft, a flooded supply tunnel, even a toilet or outer space. By coincidence, the main heroine Vicky finds herself trapped in the underground labs. Things quickly spiral out of control and Vicky must fight for her life. Expect tense moments carefully balanced with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/89d1d3dae011f3f73957aa9d9b74f516.webp?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious underground labs and uncover the secrets behind a strange incident tied to your brother Vincent’s research. On your quest for survival, you’ll overcome environmental obstacles, solve engaging puzzles and collect useful items scattered across the facility. Hidden collectibles await, unlocking new features and revealing more about the world of Subsequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/c93dd3a15ce53152019cc35976de4a9e.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/c93dd3a15ce53152019cc35976de4a9e.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/59a0b05c36fbc0175b29b5114f794dd5.webp?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world - from secret laboratories and burning elevator shafts to sleek spaceship interiors and Vicky’s cozy home where a cute animal claims its territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever logic puzzles and whatever you do, don’t cross the laser beam, it will cut you in half</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use items scattered throughout the facility to overcome obstacles and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in deep conversations - without a single dialogue choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden collectibles to unlock new features and uncover more about the world of Subsequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intuitive controls with just WASD or a gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tension and humor carefully balanced for maximum fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/44822bca366017f12c33cc6c354b6710.webp?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence doesn’t take itself too seriously. It’s a relaxed adventure with no hardcore puzzles, just enjoy the ride and, most importantly, have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME CONTROLS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control everything with WASD for movement and E for interaction or use a gamepad if you prefer. Interactive spots are clearly marked, so no pixel hunting required. Objectives appear in the top-left corner, complete them to progress to the next location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✅ What the game IS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ~2‑hour, self‑contained, atmospheric narrative experience designed to be completed in one sitting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on exploration and discovery, with only light logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist controls - WASD to move, E to interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light‑hearted tone - the game doesn’t take itself too seriously</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>❌ What the game is NOT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Subsequence</i> is not a traditional, puzzle‑heavy adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re looking for complex logic puzzles, long playtime, or branching dialogue trees, this may not be the right experience for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 🎮 Demo</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available and reflects the tone and core mechanics of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best experienced with headphones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence takes you through an underground research facility, a burning elevator shaft, a flooded supply tunnel, even a toilet or outer space. By coincidence, the main heroine Vicky finds herself trapped in the underground labs. Things quickly spiral out of control and Vicky must fight for her life. Expect tense moments carefully balanced with a touch of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/5099e7270ce54d6f002a6260b5523615.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/89d1d3dae011f3f73957aa9d9b74f516.webp?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysterious underground labs and uncover the secrets behind a strange incident tied to your brother Vincent’s research. On your quest for survival, you’ll overcome environmental obstacles, solve engaging puzzles and collect useful items scattered across the facility. Hidden collectibles await, unlocking new features and revealing more about the world of Subsequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/c93dd3a15ce53152019cc35976de4a9e.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/c93dd3a15ce53152019cc35976de4a9e.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/59a0b05c36fbc0175b29b5114f794dd5.webp?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world - from secret laboratories and burning elevator shafts to sleek spaceship interiors and Vicky’s cozy home where a cute animal claims its territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever logic puzzles and whatever you do, don’t cross the laser beam, it will cut you in half</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and use items scattered throughout the facility to overcome obstacles and survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in deep conversations - without a single dialogue choice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden collectibles to unlock new features and uncover more about the world of Subsequence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy intuitive controls with just WASD or a gamepad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tension and humor carefully balanced for maximum fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/bd8d24dd11f31ea2b9e6e1e166b79e85.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/44822bca366017f12c33cc6c354b6710.webp?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subsequence doesn’t take itself too seriously. It’s a relaxed adventure with no hardcore puzzles, just enjoy the ride and, most importantly, have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.poster.avif?t=1773591242\" width=600 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1936530/extras/d9bab73110587f510c28b7ea7705a298.webm?t=1773591242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GAME CONTROLS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control everything with WASD for movement and E for interaction or use a gamepad if you prefer. Interactive spots are clearly marked, so no pixel hunting required. Objectives appear in the top-left corner, complete them to progress to the next location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Subsequence is a story-driven adventure focused on exploration and discovery. Featuring light logic puzzles and a touch of humor, you’ll uncover hidden secrets as Vicky tries to escape the aftermath of a mysterious incident in an underground laboratory.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Polish, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.aka